    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36763" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">po</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>insep. prep.</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτί,
